  <bpmn:task id="Bridge_6_2ea1" name="The transition sentence that logically connects Process A and Process B is:&#10;&#10;**&quot;Once the customer receives order confirmation and the sales order is successfully placed in the sales process, they proceed to purchase these items from the online shop, initiating the online shopping process by logging into their account.&quot;**&#10;&#10;This transition explains how the successful order placement and confirmation from Process A naturally triggers the beginning of Process B, where the customer transitions from the sales negotiation phase to the actual online purchase and fulfillment phase." /><bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_P2B_6" sourceRef="atom_5_ExclusiveGateway_3" targetRef="Bridge_6_2ea1" /><bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_B2C_6" sourceRef="Bridge_6_2ea1" targetRef="atom_6_Task_6" /></bpmn:process>
